Wrap-up
Apple Intelligence brings a free, private, offline language model to every eligible iPhone on iOS 26, and a Capacitor app can use it with a few lines of TypeScript. Select the model, gate the UI on getReadiness(), keep each task in its own short chat, stream snapshots into the UI, and handle refusals and context errors as normal outcomes. For a broader take on shipping AI features in hybrid apps, read why Capacitor works well for AI mobile apps.
