For the best user experience when building channel-switching UIs, always use the plugin’s setChannel() method.
Best Practices

Limit Access: Channel surfing is usually for internal use - don’t expose it to all users
Handle Errors: Always handle errors gracefully when switching channels
Validate Compatibility: Ensure updates on different channels are compatible with the installed native version
Document Channels: Keep clear documentation of what each channel is for
