Shipping updates
Policy changes on the Entra side are instant, but client-side fixes still need to reach devices. TypeScript changes such as scopes or error handling can ship through Capgo live updates. Native changes (intent filters, new schemes) need a new store build, which Capgo Build can produce without a local Mac.
