Shipping and maintaining
Console changes can take a few hours to propagate, so do not rotate client IDs on release day. Once the native setup is in a store build, client-side changes such as scopes, error handling or the backend URL can go out through Capgo live updates. If your team does not have a Mac for iOS releases, Capgo Build builds and signs the iOS binary in the cloud.
